1
00:00:00,392 --> 00:00:04,392
Then I'm gonna stop at a pet store
and get licked by puppies.

2
00:00:06,941 --> 00:00:10,281
(Leonard:)-Sheldon, I need to talk to you.
-All right, my friend.

3
00:00:10,444 --> 00:00:11,904
(Sheldon:)Would you like some cholermus?

4
00:00:12,196 --> 00:00:13,736
(Leonard:)-Some what?
-Cholermus.

5
00:00:13,906 --> 00:00:15,866
(Sheldon:)It's a traditional Swiss breakfast dish.

6
00:00:16,033 --> 00:00:20,243
(Sheldon:)I'm preparing my gastrointestinal system
for the exotic cuisine of Switzerland.

7
00:00:21,163 --> 00:00:24,873
(Leonard:)-You're not going to Switzerland.
-Oh, but I am.

8
00:00:25,042 --> 00:00:26,922
(Sheldon:)Didn't Penny tell you the good news?

9
00:00:27,086 --> 00:00:30,626
(Leonard:)You went behind my back to guilt her
into letting you go instead of her.

10
00:00:30,798 --> 00:00:32,878
(Sheldon:)Yes, that good news.

11
00:00:34,093 --> 00:00:37,303
Forget it. I was the one invited,
I get to decide who goes with me.

12
00:00:37,471 --> 00:00:39,051
(Leonard:)And it's Penny, not you.

13
00:00:39,431 --> 00:00:43,101
(Sheldon:)Howard, could you lower the lights?
I have a short PowerPoint presentation.

14
00:00:43,268 --> 00:00:47,148
(Leonard:)I don't need to see your presentation.
This discussion is over.

15
00:00:47,314 --> 00:00:50,774
Well, that's a somewhat
ambiguous response. Am I going or not?

16
00:00:51,318 --> 00:00:52,898
(Leonard:)Sheldon, at this point...

17
00:00:53,070 --> 00:00:55,570
(Leonard:)...I would go by myself
before I would take you.

18
00:00:55,739 --> 00:00:57,949
(Sheldon:)-Really?
-Yeah, really.

19
00:00:58,325 --> 00:01:01,245
(Raj:)Well, then.
You leave me no alternative.

